        "6787218d-e840-4211-8177-89446e92efb9": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 32,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 224,
            "content": "## Self-provoking trigger test\n\nThe lower lane creates a customer, waits another minute (the trigger skips updates within 2 s of the create) and updates it; the trigger lane deletes it after the assert. The **Wait 1m** after OnStart must stay: the trigger registers its Shopify webhook when the flow starts, and an event provoked before the subscription exists is never delivered."
        }
